<title>UK: Dairy Farm yr profits fall but payout held.</title>
<headline>Dairy Farm yr profits fall but payout held.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   ($ million unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (cents)		1.6		    vs 7.86</p>
<p> Shr, excl except (cts) 6.19		   vs 10.38</p>
<p> Dividend (cents)	 4.35		   vs 4.35</p>
<p> Total dividend (cents) 6.0		    vs 6.0</p>
